# Default runtimes for every directory without its own .runtimesrc,
# applied by the tree-root ~/.envrc. Resolved and installed once into
# ~/.runtimesrc.lock by `runtimes ensure $HOME`; a project overrides these
# by shipping its own .runtimesrc (nearest wins). Current LTS lines:
# java 25, node 24; python has no LTS — 3.12 is the mature stable line.
python 3.12
node 17
java 22
